---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Vancouver-Langara | Roy Li">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow light">Vancouver-Langara</div>
        <h1>A common sense voice for Vancouver-Langara.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Vancouver-Langara is home to families, seniors, students, professionals, entrepreneurs, homeowners, renters, and newcomers who care about safety, affordability, opportunity, and responsible government.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="content">
      <p>Roy is seeking the BC Conservative nomination in Vancouver-Langara because the community deserves representation that is practical, economically grounded, and focused on people rather than bureaucracy.</p>
      <p>Langara is a community of long-established neighbourhoods and new arrivals, of family homes and rental towers, of students at Langara College and seniors who have lived here for decades. It deserves an MLA who listens carefully, speaks plainly, and works hard.</p>

      <h2>Local priorities</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Safe streets and neighbourhoods.</strong> Residents should feel safe walking home, riding transit, and running a business.</li>
        <li><strong>Respect for families, seniors, and taxpayers.</strong> Public money is your money, and it should be spent carefully.</li>
        <li><strong>A stronger local economy.</strong> Support for small business, employment, technology, and innovation right here in South Vancouver.</li>
        <li><strong>Accountability from Victoria.</strong> Clear answers on what the province is doing, what it costs, and whether it works.</li>
        <li><strong>Long-term planning.</strong> Fiscal discipline, less red tape, and infrastructure decisions that respect the next generation.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Have your say</h2>
      <p>Roy wants to hear directly from residents of Vancouver-Langara. If there is an issue on your street, in your building, or in your business that Victoria should be paying attention to, <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>
      <div class="notice">This is Roy Li’s personal website. Nomination outcomes are determined by the party’s official process; this page does not represent a completed nomination or an election candidacy.</div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
